From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SnowBall Contributors <dev@snowballmc.org>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mob spawning optimizations

Async counting: based on Kevin Raneri's Pufferfish patch (GPL-3.0-only),
including Leaf 0077's fixes co-authored by booky10 <boooky10@gmail.com>.
Original project: https://github.com/pufferfish-gg/Pufferfish
Original author: Kevin Raneri <kevin.raneri@gmail.com>

Sync changes: conservative subset of Leaf 0208 by hayanesuru
<hayanesuru@outlook.jp> (Leaf patch license: MIT).
Original project: https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf

Do not carry live entity, chunk, biome, or player objects into the worker.
Keep all spawn decisions and callbacks on the server thread. Keep Paper's
chunk collection, RNG sequence, border/loaded checks, and event order.

